From 662c1a892a54d137331f62b03e068eae45483d04 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xiaoxin <xiaoxin@deepseek-harness.local>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 15:50:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(mcp-client): add tool allow/deny filter for MCP
 connections

Add per-connection tool filtering via tools.allow/deny patterns in
McpConnectionOptions. Filters are applied during tool resolution so
connections can restrict which tools they expose without modifying
the remote server.

Tests: 109/109 passing.
---
 packages/mcp/mcp-client/src/connection.ts   |  1 +
 packages/mcp/mcp-client/src/index.ts        | 15 ++++-
 packages/mcp/mcp-client/src/tools.ts        | 28 ++++++++
 packages/mcp/mcp-client/tests/apply.spec.ts | 71 +++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 114 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

